<h2>Check 05: Links</h2>
<p><strong>Expected:</strong> Links should be easy to recognize in normal text, hover state, and keyboard focus state. Long link labels should wrap cleanly without breaking the article layout.</p>
<p>This is a normal external link to <a href="https://www.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Apple official website</a>.</p>
<p>This is a deliberately long link label: <a href="https://www.apple.com/iphone/compare/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">compare iPhone models, display sizes, camera features, storage options, battery life, and long-term software support</a>.</p>

<h2>Check 06: Images and Captions</h2>
<p><strong>Expected:</strong> Images should stay within the article column, keep their aspect ratio, and use stable spacing. Captions should be readable, visually connected to the image, and not collide with following content.</p>
