<h2>Check 08: Blockquote, Code, and HR</h2>
<p><strong>Expected:</strong> Blockquotes, inline code, code blocks, and horizontal rules should all have intentional article styles. They should not appear as raw browser defaults, and they should not overflow the content column.</p>
<blockquote>
  <p>A good article template makes quoted content feel intentional. Blockquotes should not look like unstyled paragraphs, and they should not overflow the content column.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Inline code such as <code>article.content</code>, <code>table-wrapper</code>, and <code>scroll-margin-top</code> should be visually distinct without disrupting line height.</p>
<pre><code>const articleCheck = {
