};

console.log(articleCheck);</code></pre>
<hr>
<p>The final paragraph verifies that spacing after tables, quotes, code blocks, and horizontal rules returns to a normal article rhythm. Nothing should feel glued together, visually raw, or wider than the main content column.</p>

